WEBVTT

00:00:04.932 --> 00:00:10.235
In odrder to ward off the image of Anthony
which burned itself deeply in Candy's heart,

00:00:10.484 --> 00:00:12.668
...Terry forced Candy to ride a horse.

00:00:14.031 --> 00:00:24.094
It was summer day's afternoon, the fresh breeze beckoned
Candy's heart, and the green forrest was dazzling.

00:00:24.982 --> 00:00:30.591
White party for two.

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:53.361
Somehow... it feels as if we were like this
for a very long time now...

00:00:57.281 --> 00:00:58.391
You're bleeding.

00:00:58.412 --> 00:00:59.746
Huh? When did I...

00:01:00.016 --> 00:01:03.071
You must have snagged a branch when
we were riding.

00:01:03.852 --> 00:01:05.384
I'm fine, Terry.

00:01:06.217 --> 00:01:08.052
I can't just leave it like this.

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.118
Terry...

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:15.799
I can't believe that this Terry and the rude Terry
from a while ago are the same people.

00:01:15.847 --> 00:01:17.011
It's okay now.

00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:21.318
It was a bit rude, but I don't regret it.

00:01:21.776 --> 00:01:23.795
It smells wonderful!

00:01:26.365 --> 00:01:27.909
This lake...

00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:30.891
Your mother loved this lake, didn't she?

00:01:33.251 --> 00:01:37.251
She's on a ship to America right now.

00:01:50.806 --> 00:01:52.866
Cut it out, already.

00:01:54.365 --> 00:01:55.520
Such a story...

00:01:58.038 --> 00:01:59.640
Hey, Candy!

00:02:01.243 --> 00:02:02.299
Candy!

00:02:02.311 --> 00:02:03.713
Candy!

00:02:04.863 --> 00:02:06.426
It's Annie and the others!

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:09.817
Candy!

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:12.568
I'm over here!

00:02:13.406 --> 00:02:16.109
That's Terry next to Candy...

00:02:16.533 --> 00:02:17.851
Looks like it.

00:02:18.895 --> 00:02:20.882
Out of all guys, she picks him...

00:02:20.996 --> 00:02:26.279
Brother, go faster!
Hurry! Hurry, I'm telling you!

00:02:26.859 --> 00:02:28.566
Nasty people are here.

00:02:31.176 --> 00:02:36.417
-Hurry, brother!
-What's gotten into you, all of a sudden?

00:02:36.565 --> 00:02:38.845
I want to see with whom
is Candy hanging around!

00:02:43.499 --> 00:02:44.398
Terry!

00:02:44.433 --> 00:02:46.178
Eliza, look out!
Sit down!

00:02:47.863 --> 00:02:51.288
He's hanging around with Candy!
Get me to the beach, brother!

00:02:51.307 --> 00:02:53.117
Don't move, dammit!

00:02:54.295 --> 00:02:56.174
What are you doing?

00:03:01.058 --> 00:03:02.036
Eliza!

00:03:07.305 --> 00:03:08.374
Eliza!

00:03:12.142 --> 00:03:13.264
Help!

00:03:14.384 --> 00:03:16.050
-Help!
-Eliza!

00:03:20.027 --> 00:03:22.669
-We have to help them!
-What should we do, brother?

00:03:23.567 --> 00:03:26.238
They didn't keep their boat still
and now they're swimming.

00:03:26.609 --> 00:03:29.095
-Let's wait a bit before helping them.
-Alright.

00:03:29.245 --> 00:03:33.327
-But... they need help, Archie!
-There is plenty of energy in Eliza!

00:03:38.495 --> 00:03:39.447
Terry!

00:03:42.385 --> 00:03:44.905
Help me! I'm dying!

00:03:48.247 --> 00:03:50.502
-Terry!
-Don't grab me like this, you'll pull me down too!

00:03:55.243 --> 00:03:56.647
Terry saved her.

00:03:57.383 --> 00:03:59.947
Hey! Help me too!

00:04:00.129 --> 00:04:03.054
Neil, don't be so absent-minded while rowing,
you might overturn the boat!

00:04:18.009 --> 00:04:20.781
-Eliza! Get a hold of yourself!
-Maybe she inhaled some water...

00:04:22.478 --> 00:04:24.417
-Eliza!
-Is she okay?

00:04:24.811 --> 00:04:29.945
Yeah. But you surprised me; three guys
and not a single one of you can swim!

00:04:30.072 --> 00:04:33.831
-What?
-Both I and Stear can swim!

00:04:34.222 --> 00:04:36.911
Oh? So you chickened out?

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:40.743
Eliza wasn't drowning!
She was swimming pretty well!

00:04:40.759 --> 00:04:42.814
It's just that we weren't
too sorry for her...

00:04:43.132 --> 00:04:44.359
You can swim?

00:04:45.608 --> 00:04:48.030
Just a few moments more and
I would've drowned there.

00:04:48.127 --> 00:04:50.238
Terry, I owe you my life!

00:04:52.456 --> 00:04:56.974
You cowards!
What would you do if I died?

00:04:58.621 --> 00:05:00.759
Eliza, dry your hair with this...

00:05:08.435 --> 00:05:12.946
Say, Terry, won't you come to the Adley's
mansion? I have to thank you for this.

00:05:13.689 --> 00:05:15.376
That's so nice, Terry!

00:05:15.906 --> 00:05:17.885
Candy, you stay away!

00:05:20.029 --> 00:05:25.859
Eliza, I'm grateful for your invitation,
but my own mansion is close by.

00:05:27.316 --> 00:05:29.924
-Then, can I come over to your place?
-Eliza...!

00:05:29.959 --> 00:05:33.833
Nah, there are no servants in my mansion
and I have nothing to treat you with.

00:05:34.561 --> 00:05:35.246
Bye.

00:05:37.044 --> 00:05:39.217
What a snob...!

00:05:41.602 --> 00:05:45.988
I'm going back! You're going to come along!
You'll be punished for not helping me!

00:05:46.023 --> 00:05:48.079
Pick up my stuff and go!

00:05:51.148 --> 00:05:52.009
Candy.

00:05:52.527 --> 00:05:54.199
You're going to stay away.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:55.775
Eliza?

00:05:55.968 --> 00:05:59.291
Grand aunt Elroy will be sick
if she sees your face!

00:06:00.389 --> 00:06:02.275
Eliza! How can you...

00:06:03.352 --> 00:06:07.732
You'd just let me die!
I'll tell Aunt about this! Let's go.

00:06:08.662 --> 00:06:09.631
Oh, boy.

00:06:14.962 --> 00:06:19.469
Candy, don't worry about Eliza's words,
anyway, let's go to the mansion. Okay?

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:22.928
I'll pass.
I'd rather take a nap in the shade.

00:06:25.352 --> 00:06:28.582
-Annie, go along with others!
-But...

00:06:31.733 --> 00:06:33.167
You don't need to worry.

00:06:33.675 --> 00:06:35.179
-Bye!
-Candy!

00:06:35.339 --> 00:06:37.482
Candy! Where are you going?

00:06:51.565 --> 00:06:54.417
What's gotten into Terry today?

00:06:58.177 --> 00:07:02.616
Moreover, he was rude again... he left
without saying anything to me.

00:07:05.919 --> 00:07:07.069
Mark!

00:07:07.549 --> 00:07:09.186
You have some business with my bro?

00:07:09.796 --> 00:07:11.500
It's not that I have some business with him...

00:07:11.542 --> 00:07:15.194
Hmmh, you say that you don't have any business
with him but you keep loitering around here...

00:07:15.229 --> 00:07:18.534
Don't say such weird things!
Mark, what did you come here for?

00:07:19.087 --> 00:07:22.299
I brought some milk and bread my mom made.

00:07:23.042 --> 00:07:26.536
Terry will be glad.
He's probably hungry by now.

00:07:28.253 --> 00:07:30.466
-Bye!
-Bye, Candy...

00:07:34.444 --> 00:07:35.503
Strange.

00:07:39.206 --> 00:07:43.592
What's gotten into me? I'm wandering around
Terry's house without a reason.

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.128
Pull yourself together, Candy!
Ow!

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:20.576
Annie, I had no idea you were this good!

00:08:22.458 --> 00:08:24.208
It's because this piano is good...

00:08:24.625 --> 00:08:28.501
Why, this is a nice room!
It's like we're in some snow-covered land.

00:08:30.153 --> 00:08:32.998
This room is according to
aunt Elroy's tastes.

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:36.677
That's why we don't think it's too pretty.

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:41.097
Doesn't matter how white a room may be,
if a person who lives inside has a dark soul...

00:08:42.068 --> 00:08:42.917
Archie!

00:08:48.475 --> 00:08:53.626
-What was that dark thing you mentioned?
-N..nothing... you have a wonderful dress and...!

00:08:53.661 --> 00:08:57.154
-Really!
-It really matches this room!

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:58.487
Thank-you.

00:09:01.302 --> 00:09:04.370
I just got a permission from aunt Elroy.

00:09:04.543 --> 00:09:05.943
A permission for what?

00:09:06.522 --> 00:09:10.487
We'll make a party for Terry next Sunday,
in order to express my gratitude.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:12.735
A party?

00:09:12.929 --> 00:09:16.304
I'm still alive because of Terry.

00:09:16.685 --> 00:09:18.207
Cut that out, already.

00:09:19.428 --> 00:09:22.537
Stear, you disagree with aunt's decisions?

00:09:23.054 --> 00:09:25.004
I didn't say that...

00:09:25.765 --> 00:09:29.469
In Sunday, we'll be throwing
a white party in this room!

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:35.204
A white party?

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:41.172
That's right! Your dress, shoes, parasol,
they all need to be white!

00:09:42.737 --> 00:09:44.896
It'll look like a nurse party!

00:09:45.086 --> 00:09:48.904
Archie and Stear wanted me to ask
you to come to the party!

00:09:49.114 --> 00:09:52.939
I'm glad for your invitations, but I think
I'll pass up on this all-in-white party!

00:09:53.093 --> 00:09:55.299
Just thinking about it gives me the willies.

00:09:56.171 --> 00:09:58.434
But Terry is going to come, too!

00:09:58.710 --> 00:10:00.203
Does it matter?

00:10:01.485 --> 00:10:05.212
Terry absolutely hates busy, noisy events.

00:10:09.215 --> 00:10:11.254
Did he say that he'll be coming?

00:10:12.383 --> 00:10:13.341
Yes...

00:10:14.535 --> 00:10:16.045
I...

00:10:19.837 --> 00:10:23.776
I'm not going.
...to this white party.

00:10:23.939 --> 00:10:26.763
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
The next few episodes have a really noisy audio track.
I'd like to apologize for any errors in translation
that might have occured due to the unintelligible audio.

00:10:37.353 --> 00:10:38.580
Candy...

00:10:39.222 --> 00:10:41.973
Don't worry about me, you two!

00:10:42.847 --> 00:10:44.912
Sorry for going without you...

00:10:45.407 --> 00:10:47.673
What are you saying!
You two look wonderful in white!

00:10:47.828 --> 00:10:48.959
Kurin!

00:10:50.988 --> 00:10:55.577
Kurin, you want to see them?
Aren't Annie and Patty pretty?

00:10:55.968 --> 00:10:59.417
Now, see you later! You don't want to be late?

00:11:03.237 --> 00:11:05.779
You'll get burnt if you don't
open that parasol!

00:11:08.187 --> 00:11:12.600
White party... when I look at those
two, I'm still just a little bit jealous!

00:11:12.749 --> 00:11:15.780
Alright! I'll throw my own party!

00:11:23.748 --> 00:11:26.841
Candice White's special act!

00:11:30.232 --> 00:11:33.316
I haven't done this in a while,
my skills must have gone a bit.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:40.191
Maybe I put on some weight?

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:53.319
Candy?

00:11:54.074 --> 00:11:55.022
Terry!

00:11:55.624 --> 00:11:56.937
I'm surprised!

00:11:57.667 --> 00:12:01.263
Me too! I didn't know there
were monkeys in this forest.

00:12:02.691 --> 00:12:03.979
You saw me?

00:12:04.609 --> 00:12:08.315
What's the matter? Aren't you
going to the white party?

00:12:08.481 --> 00:12:11.519
Yes. They don't want me there, anyway.

00:12:11.595 --> 00:12:13.891
If you're not going, I'm not going either.

00:12:14.836 --> 00:12:16.347
Really, Terry?

00:12:16.511 --> 00:12:18.452
I couldn't spoil that smile on your face.

00:12:19.197 --> 00:12:21.813
Say, won't you come to my place?
There are ghosts in my mansion.

00:12:22.818 --> 00:12:24.992
I'd like to see those ghosts!

00:12:33.125 --> 00:12:39.759
Annie, Patty, you two look gorgeous in white!
You could pass off as twins from now on!

00:12:39.794 --> 00:12:42.079
Strange, he's so late...

00:12:42.281 --> 00:12:44.087
It's because he's so whimsical.

00:12:44.367 --> 00:12:47.956
He's going to come!
He would've informed us otherwise!

00:12:47.957 --> 00:12:49.730
Anyway, let's begin.

00:12:50.431 --> 00:12:51.490
Hold on a sec.

00:13:05.968 --> 00:13:07.430
It's dark!

00:13:11.373 --> 00:13:13.306
They've been here since old times.

00:13:13.956 --> 00:13:15.743
They look as if they were alive.

00:13:15.959 --> 00:13:19.157
Not really, but the truth is,
they get scary when ghosts get in them.

00:13:19.192 --> 00:13:19.954
No way!

00:13:22.064 --> 00:13:24.125
Candy, look! Behind you!

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:37.546
These arms are great when a girl
needs to be embraced.

00:13:37.737 --> 00:13:38.918
Terry!

00:13:42.437 --> 00:13:44.122
That joke was a bit too much!

00:13:44.652 --> 00:13:46.555
Candy, looks like it's going to rain.

00:13:54.635 --> 00:13:55.628
There it goes.

00:13:55.951 --> 00:13:58.312
It feels like it's suddenly become cold.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:01.208
-Put this on.
-Thank you.

00:14:04.143 --> 00:14:05.214
This is...

00:14:05.371 --> 00:14:07.023
A forgotten gown.

00:14:07.348 --> 00:14:08.665
It's your mother's?

00:14:08.775 --> 00:14:11.248
She said; I'd like that freckled girl to have it.

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:12.855
To me...

00:14:32.416 --> 00:14:35.150
It's rude! Announcing his arrival
and then not showing up...!

00:14:35.288 --> 00:14:37.801
Aunt Elroy is upset too!

00:14:38.681 --> 00:14:40.427
He must've caught a cold or something.

00:14:42.602 --> 00:14:45.838
That's it! I'm sure it is!
I'm going over to his place!

00:14:46.257 --> 00:14:49.788
-Come on, during this storm...
-But...

00:14:53.106 --> 00:14:55.222
You'll go when the rain stops?

00:15:06.398 --> 00:15:08.739
White party at the Adley's.

00:15:09.028 --> 00:15:12.380
And here, we're sitting next to this fire,
it feels like Christmas.

00:15:13.424 --> 00:15:15.262
She said the same thing.

00:15:15.409 --> 00:15:16.505
Who?

00:15:22.859 --> 00:15:24.884
Your mother said that, I see.

00:15:25.959 --> 00:15:28.674
On that day... when it got dark, we spoke...

00:15:37.777 --> 00:15:40.292
What did you two talk about?

00:15:40.845 --> 00:15:42.948
Nothing special.

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:45.476
Though you didn't see her for ten years...

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:49.176
We just stood together near the fireplace until dawn.

00:16:01.969 --> 00:16:06.427
She came all the way from America to see you...
And you two didn't talk at all.

00:16:08.761 --> 00:16:10.729
I wasn't the only one who couldn't speak.

00:16:12.352 --> 00:16:14.047
Your mother, too?

00:16:14.676 --> 00:16:20.619
While I was sitting with her next to the fireplace,
I got this warm feeling, as if it were Christmas.

00:16:22.256 --> 00:16:26.582
Just by sitting there in silence... I felt
as if our hearts were being connected.

00:16:35.095 --> 00:16:40.375
If someone made me spend a whole night with my
father and my new 'mother', I would've gone crazy.

00:16:41.003 --> 00:16:45.748
Just spending time with her in silence - -
it was such a wonderful feeling.

00:16:50.311 --> 00:16:52.223
That's what a real parent is.

00:16:53.956 --> 00:16:55.835
That's what a real mother is.

00:17:01.134 --> 00:17:04.059
I've never felt this strange before.

00:17:07.683 --> 00:17:09.650
What's the matter, Candy?

00:17:11.087 --> 00:17:13.182
I'm just a little jealous.

00:17:13.183 --> 00:17:13.985
Jealous of me?

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:17.405
Because there isn't such a person for me.

00:17:21.341 --> 00:17:25.978
Say, would you care if the two of us stood
by the fireplace till dawn?

00:17:39.574 --> 00:17:40.529
Candy.

00:17:46.294 --> 00:17:47.389
Eliza?

00:17:48.615 --> 00:17:50.500
So that's what you've been up to!

00:17:54.055 --> 00:17:56.915
You ambushed Terry while he was
on his way to my party!

00:17:57.697 --> 00:17:58.824
That's not true!

00:17:59.244 --> 00:18:00.465
Does it matter?

00:18:11.807 --> 00:18:13.126
You crook!

00:18:19.837 --> 00:18:24.623
Eliza, the way you enter people's homes without
permission will tarnish Adley's name!

00:18:25.241 --> 00:18:26.717
I'll remember this!

00:18:29.613 --> 00:18:31.773
-Eliza!
-Let her go.

00:18:32.096 --> 00:18:37.129
-But she is going to vent on Annie and Patty...
-Are you their guardian?

00:18:38.339 --> 00:18:39.659
It's not that...

00:18:39.841 --> 00:18:42.428
They aren't children.

00:18:44.851 --> 00:18:46.060
But...

00:18:55.856 --> 00:18:58.210
Candy is in Terry's mansion?

00:18:58.567 --> 00:19:00.970
When you think about it, that's
exactly what I'd expect of her!

00:19:01.225 --> 00:19:04.200
It's because Candy was brought up in Pony's home!

00:19:05.303 --> 00:19:06.656
Eliza.

00:19:07.326 --> 00:19:11.494
Oh? Come to think of it, you too
came from Pony's home.

00:19:11.692 --> 00:19:13.122
Stop that, Eliza!

00:19:13.276 --> 00:19:14.943
No, I won't.

00:19:15.566 --> 00:19:19.772
Either you all leave now or I'll ask around
about her... it's your call.

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:26.877
Everyone, Annie will play the piano for us
at the end of this party.

00:19:27.481 --> 00:19:29.718
-Annie.
-Patty...

00:19:30.115 --> 00:19:32.127
Now. It's okay.

00:19:33.265 --> 00:19:36.012
Hold on. I'm running this party!

00:19:36.144 --> 00:19:37.771
We know, Eliza.

00:19:39.545 --> 00:19:42.264
At the end of her performance, we'll offer
you our greetings.

00:19:42.642 --> 00:19:43.897
Patty!

00:20:25.743 --> 00:20:27.461
That's right, Candy!

00:20:27.625 --> 00:20:30.340
But Patty was there for me.

00:20:30.873 --> 00:20:33.988
I see. Both of you have become stronger.

00:20:34.022 --> 00:20:37.160
It's because of this summer school!
Right, Annie?

00:20:37.195 --> 00:20:37.715
Yes.

00:20:38.713 --> 00:20:40.404
Because of summer school?

00:20:42.369 --> 00:20:49.365
Living in this huge Scottish countryside made both
the anguish and loneliness seem like trivial matters.

00:20:49.985 --> 00:20:53.494
My heart is jumping like it somehow became stronger!

00:20:54.793 --> 00:20:55.906
Really!

00:20:57.536 --> 00:21:02.465
Seeing the cheerful faces of Annie and Patty
which have turned lively and strong,

00:21:02.850 --> 00:21:06.629
...Candy was glad to have come to Scotland
from the bottom of her heart.

00:21:07.716 --> 00:21:14.391
And Candy herself decided that she'll wonderfully spend
those few days that have remained of summer school.

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:20.284
To be continued.
